<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SCI estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SCI estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Robertson Stephens &amp; Company research analyst Keith Dunne raised his estimates today on SCI Systems Inc and reiterated a buy rating.</p>
<p>- Based on SCI Systems stronger than expected second quarter results, we are raising our EPS estimates from $3.15 to $3.25 in fiscal year 1997 and from $3.85 to $4.05 in FY98.</p>
</text>
